  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一個 Serilum 模組。用心製作。適用於 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的多款活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於本模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>名稱標籤調整對遊戲中的命名牌物品進行了一些改動。擁有自訂名稱的生物死亡時會掉落其命名牌。新增一個指令，無需鐵砧即可更改命名牌的名稱。此外，本模組還添加了一個合成配方。</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依賴項\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"包含於「原版體驗」整合包\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/extra-bundle.svg&w=700\" alt=\"包含於 Serilum 的額外組合包\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的設定選項：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示內容</summary>\n<p><span><strong>droppedNameTagbyEntityKeepsNameValue</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>啟用後，生物死亡時掉落的命名牌將保留其名稱數值。<br><br><span><strong>enableNameTagCommand</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>啟用後，將新增 /nametag &lt;名稱&gt; 指令。可用於無需鐵砧即可更改名稱數值。<br><br><span><strong>nameTagCommandReplaceUnderscoresWithSpaces</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>啟用後，使用 /nametag 指令時，底線將被空格取代。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>合成配方：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/name-tag-tweaks/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"504\" height=\"288\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>/nametag &lt;名稱&gt; 指令：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/name-tag-tweaks/b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"439\" height=\"118\"><span><br><strong>以及結果：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/name-tag-tweaks/c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"979\" height=\"220\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>這裡可以看到一隻已被命名的豬死亡時掉落其命名牌：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/name-tag-tweaks/d.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"520\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>只要下載連結仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 平台內，您可以自由地將此模組用於任何模組包中。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 包含了所有可用模組的概覽及更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他任何事項，請前往&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 儲存庫</a>。感謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
